			"text": "Network API — Procedural Graph Building\n\nAll Script operators expose:\n  network_add_node(type, id) → id\n  network_remove_node(id)\n  network_connect(from, fp, to, tp)\n  network_disconnect(from, fp, to, tp)\n  network_node_ids() → PackedStringArray\n  network_node_info(id) → Dictionary\n\nNodes are created via GNExtensionRegistry.",
